# Terraform
terraform/.terraform/
# terraform/.terraform.lock.hcl is intentionally NOT ignored: it is now committed
# for the flat root module (TF-4 / TRO-237) so provider versions no longer float
# between machines/CI. Only the .terraform/ provider binary cache above stays ignored.
terraform/terraform.tfstate
terraform/terraform.tfstate.backup
terraform/*.tfplan
terraform/tfplan
terraform/terraform.tfvars
terraform/environments/*/terraform.tfvars
terraform/environments/*/.terraform.lock.hcl

# Terraform: plan output under terraform/environments/ (TF-9 / TRO-292).
# terraform/*.tfplan and terraform/tfplan above are anchored one level deep
# (no `**`), so they never covered terraform/environments/<env>/tfplan —
# that's how terraform/environments/shadow/tfplan got committed (~28.5KB
# binary plan, no rewrite of existing history, just closing the gap going
# forward). Matches the `environments/*/` glob already used for tfvars and
# lock files two lines up, so it covers every current and future
# environment (shadow, dev, ...) rather than shadow alone.
terraform/environments/*/*.tfplan
terraform/environments/*/tfplan
terraform/bootstrap/.terraform/
terraform/bootstrap/.terraform.lock.hcl
terraform/bootstrap/terraform.tfstate
terraform/bootstrap/terraform.tfstate.backup
terraform/.tfbackend
terraform/test-runner/.terraform/
terraform/test-runner/.terraform.lock.hcl
terraform/test-runner/terraform.tfstate
terraform/test-runner/terraform.tfstate.backup

# Terraform: Render provider config (TF-10 / TRO-299). Only *.tfplan/tfplan
# actually need a new rule here: terraform/.gitignore's pre-existing
# *.tfvars / .terraform/ / *.tfstate* patterns are unanchored (no leading
# slash), so they already apply recursively to terraform/render/ too —
# verified empirically against the pre-this-ticket file. That corrects
# memory-bank/techContext.md, which asserted "a new
# terraform/render/terraform.tfvars would NOT be ignored" — that check only
# looked at this file's terraform/*-specific lines above and missed the
# nested terraform/.gitignore's blanket coverage. Filed as a memory-bank
# correction (see memory-bank/progress.md).
terraform/render/*.tfplan
terraform/render/tfplan

